      "name": "fresh parsley",
      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "chopped"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the cataplana vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the crushed san-marzano tomatoes, orange juice, honey, dried thyme, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 20 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook for an additional 10 minutes, or until the stew has thickened slightly.",
    "Stir in the chopped fresh parsley.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
  ],
